%% UC-31 — Give informed consent (App Store 5.1.3 / GDPR Art. 6(1)(a), 9(2)(a))
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App (ConsentScreen)
    participant B as Backend
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Tap "Get Started"
    F->>B: GET /:locale/consent (public)
    B-->>F: {content: HTML, document: {version, effectiveDate, bindingLanguage}}
    F-->>P: Render HabConnect study information + consent text
    alt consents
        P->>F: Tap "I consent"
        F->>F: Store consent version + locale + timestamp (secure storage)
        F->>F: Continue to account creation (passphrase screen)
        Note over F,B: After account creation & login:
        F->>B: POST /api/v1/users/me/consent {consentVersion, locale} (Bearer)
        B->>M: insert(consents) — append-only audit record
        B-->>F: 201
    else declines
        P->>F: Tap "I do not consent"
        F-->>P: Return to welcome screen — no account, no data collected
    end
